// onjo1_m1.wac
// Indigo Storm: the base game's Indigo Shore at night in a storm. The rain at full and a quarter of the
// overcast's colours from the start, written as the original's rainy missions write theirs (TKP_C2A,
// ASB_G11A): the first execution, at the start, sets both targets and the start's weather settle brings
// them in before play. Then the storm's lightning, which the script asks for itself: the script runs once
// a second, and each second a far strike comes one time in 25 and a near one, its thunder close by, one
// time in 70.
if never() then
	rain(100,1)
	overcast(25,1)
endif
if random(25) then
	farflash()
endif
if random(70) then
	flash()
endif
